Package: spatialTXsuite
Title: Spatial Transcriptomics Analysis in R Shiny
Version: 1.6.1
Authors@R: person("Muralidharan", "Mani", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-1194-3616"))
Description: Interactive Shiny application for SpatialExperiment data from Visium, GEO-style Visium files, Xenium, MERFISH and CosMx. Covers import from a sample sheet, platform-aware QC, normalisation, joint cross-section spatial domains, per-section spatial autocorrelation (Moran's I, Geary's C) and replicate-aware pseudobulk differential expression with edgeR, including covariates and pseudoreplication checks.
